  "body": "Coastal lifestyle without the cost!\r\n\r\n* Great opportunity for first-home buyers\r\n* Double-glazed, modern-build, high-quality home\r\n* Four bedrooms, two bathrooms\r\n* Perfect floor plan for families or flatmates\r\n* Spacious living with plenty of natural light\r\n* Open-plan kitchen and dining with separate pantry\r\n* Two heat pumps and generous master wardrobe\r\n* Internal-access garage and excellent storage\r\n* Zoned for Orewa College\r\n\r\nHere it is!\r\nYou've found it.\r\nWhere location, size and price all stack up.\r\nFour bedrooms. \r\nTwo bathrooms.\r\nIn a fantastic central location.\r\nPerfect for first home buyers.\r\nReady to go.\r\n\r\nModern design.\r\nBright, spacious, sun-filled living.\r\nAn open-plan kitchen and dining area.\r\nA separate pantry.\r\nOodles of storage.\r\nQuality laminate flooring.\r\n\r\nTwo heat pumps.\r\nA master bedroom with a big wardrobe.\r\nBedrooms spread across three levels for privacy.\r\nA fantastic space for coming together for meals.\r\nAn internal access garage with plenty of room for vehicles, tools, toys or a home gym.\r\n\r\nA three-minute walk to the local cafe.\r\nFive minutes to Ridgedale playground.\r\nClose to Kings Way, Stella Maris & Silverdale Schools.\r\nIn zone for Orewa College.\r\n\r\nJust a short drive to Orewa Beach, the estuary, walkways and bike tracks.\r\nAn incredible opportunity!\r\nAnd it must be sold.\r\n\r\nCome and say hello, have a look around and get it while you can!\r\nPlease contact Tim for more info.\r\nConjunctions welcome.",
